    </mxCell>
    <mxCell id="s1_note" value="&lt;b&gt;⚠ Bottlenecks&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Cloud Run: 1 instance, cold starts&lt;br&gt;• Cloud SQL f1-micro: 25 connections max&lt;br&gt;• Vertex AI: synchronous, blocks API response&lt;br&gt;• No CDN — photos served from GCS directly&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Est. cost: ~$10/month&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;fontSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#FFF3CD;strokeColor=#FFC107;" vertex="1" parent="s1">
