    </mxCell>
    <mxCell id="s2_note" value="&lt;b&gt;✓ Changes vs State 1&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Cloud Run: config only (set maxInstances)&lt;br&gt;• PgBouncer: prevents connection exhaustion&lt;br&gt;• Cloud SQL: bigger tier + read replica&lt;br&gt;• Cloud CDN: 10× faster photo delivery&lt;br&gt;• Cloud Tasks: AI no longer blocks requests&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Est. cost: ~$50–150/month&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;fontSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#D4EDDA;strokeColor=#28A745;" vertex="1" parent="s2">
