    <mxCell id="s3_note" value="&lt;b&gt;✓✓ Changes vs State 2&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• API Gateway: rate limiting, DDoS protection&lt;br&gt;• Cloud Run: split into domain microservices&lt;br&gt;• Cloud Spanner replaces PostgreSQL (unlimited)&lt;br&gt;• Cloud Storage: multi-region + global CDN&lt;br&gt;• Pub/Sub: decoupled async AI worker pool&lt;br&gt;• Firebase Auth &amp;amp; Firestore: unchanged (serverless)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Est. cost: ~$5K–15K/month&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;fontSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#D4EDDA;strokeColor=#28A745;" vertex="1" parent="s3">
